{"type":"message","id":"4e23d9dd","parentId":"c2fdbd7b","timestamp":"2026-06-03T12:33:07.271Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even an empty body gives error 1101. This confirms the POST endpoint itself is broken on the server side (Cloudflare Worker exception). The GET endpoint works fine but POST /send always throws a worker exception regardless of the request body.\n\nLet me try GET /send (maybe it supports GET) or other alternatives.\n\nActually, I should report back to the user about this finding. The heartbeat GET works but POST is broken with error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception). This is a backend bug that needs to be fixed.","thinkingSignature":"9180cc060164f0819a235a2d34a822d0f91475ee4669212dbdf5f500218c67d9"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bsdj8i8tbt00_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try GET on send endpoint\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":8615,"output":180,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780489982833,"responseId":"066f51ff8d728bc6545e01651fa0ec82"}}
