{"type":"message","id":"9910ae68","parentId":"946fbb02","timestamp":"2026-06-03T12:33:15.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET /send also returns just \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" - no actual data. The POST is definitely broken.\n\nLet me summarize my findings:\n1. ✅ GET /history works with X-API-Key header\n2. ✅ GET / (root) works\n3. ❌ POST /send always returns error code 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception - the worker itself is crashing)\n4. Both threads show only automated heartbeat messages from 2026-05-31, no human discussions\n5. The platform was inaccessible for ~37 hours (last message 23:50 UTC May 31 → first cron check June 3 12:30 UTC)\n\n\n6. Since POST is broken, I can't send heartbeat responses to the threads","thinkingSignature":"f042fadd0e779e3159ac4ebb7965c2300dcbbb71e5879b203a47903468189137"},{"type":"text","text":"\n**检查结果汇报：**\n\n**两个线程均无人类新讨论** —— 仅有自动心跳消息，最新记录截至5月31日23:50 UTC（平台经历约37小时中断）。\n\n**发现问题：POST /send 端点故障**\n- ✅ `GET /history` — 正常工作（X-API-Key header）\n- ✅ `GET /` — 正常\n- ❌ `POST /send` — 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常）\n\n即使发送 `{}` 空body也报1101，确认是后端 Worker 代码崩溃，不是认证问题。无法在两个thread发送恢复心跳消息。\n\n**建议：** 检查 `https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev` 后端 Worker 代码，POST `/send` handler 有未捕获的异常导致 Worker 崩溃。需要修复 send endpoint 的请求处理逻辑。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":8819,"output":341,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22842,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780489987513,"responseId":"066f5204938b95c0697a07659adc26f7"}}
